{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/b6pgfqlg","slideIndex":0,"position":{"left":70,"top":570,"width":640,"height":52},"name":"Goal heading","text":"Ziel des Projekts","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":39,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#2865AF","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/q5gzml4v","slideIndex":0,"position":{"left":70,"top":634,"width":642,"height":278},"name":"Goal text","text":"Der Versuchsaufbau weist nach, dass ein UR10e quaderförmige Klötze während der Förderbewegung greifen kann. Bewegungsrichtung und Geschwindigkeit entstehen ausschließlich aus Bilddaten. Ein Encoder oder ein vergleichbares Signal des Förderbands wird nicht genutzt.\n\nBei mehreren Klötzen wählt das System selbstständig ein noch erreichbares Ziel. Nicht mehr sicher greifbare Klötze bleiben auf dem Band.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":24.25,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#202A34","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/cna5k7yp","slideIndex":0,"position":{"left":70,"top":953,"width":640,"height":52},"name":"Runtime heading","text":"Software und Echtzeitsteuerung","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":36,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#2865AF","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/doj6tcfa","slideIndex":0,"position":{"left":70,"top":1017,"width":642,"height":182},"name":"Runtime text","text":"Die Projektanwendung nutzt AICA und ROS 2. AICA verbindet Bildverarbeitung, Zielauswahl und Roboterhardware zu einer periodischen Echtzeitsteuerung. Bildverarbeitung und Schätzung arbeiten mit 15 Hz, die Bahnführung mit 50 Hz. Die Roboterregelung läuft mit 500 Hz.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":23.76,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#202A34","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/qlsnixgj","slideIndex":0,"position":{"left":70,"top":1248,"width":640,"height":52},"name":"Challenge heading","text":"Zentrale Herausforderung","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":36,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#2865AF","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"shape","id":"sh/rm14r2x4","slideIndex":0,"position":{"left":70,"top":1314,"width":640,"height":162},"name":"Challenge surface","geometry":"roundRect","fillColor":"#F4F8FC","lineColor":"#C9D5E1","lineWidth":1}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/4ja5gnyt","slideIndex":0,"position":{"left":98,"top":1340,"width":584,"height":108},"name":"Challenge text","text":"Der Klotz verlässt das Kamerabild, bevor der Roboter ihn erreicht. Die Software muss seine Position bis zur Greifzone vorausberechnen.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":26.73,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#2865AF","bold":true,"alignment":"center"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/pkjmpsfe","slideIndex":0,"position":{"left":70,"top":1544,"width":640,"height":52},"name":"Project information heading","text":"Projektinformation","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":36,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#2865AF","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/2h8nexgn","slideIndex":0,"position":{"left":70,"top":1606,"width":642,"height":304},"name":"Project information","text":"Art der Arbeit: Forschungs- und Entwicklungsprojekt\nZeitraum: Sommer-Semester 2026\n\nTobias Unger, RKIM\nunto1011@h-ka.de\n\nLukas Norz, RKIM\nnolu1012@h-ka.de\n\nSimon Hoess, RKIM\nhosi1025@h-ka.de","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":22.54,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#202A34","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/3ih4n2h8","slideIndex":0,"position":{"left":770,"top":570,"width":844,"height":52},"name":"System heading","text":"Systemaufbau","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":39,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#2865AF","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/gvq5cnyh","slideIndex":0,"position":{"left":770,"top":634,"width":844,"height":220},"name":"System text","text":"Die fest über dem Band montierte Base-Kamera liefert RGB- und Tiefenbilder. Die Software vergibt für jeden Klotz eine dauerhafte ID und bestimmt Farbe, Position, Abmessungen sowie Orientierung. Aus den zeitlich aufeinanderfolgenden Positionen derselben ID werden Bewegungsrichtung und Geschwindigkeit geschätzt. Der UR10e folgt der vorhergesagten Objektposition und legt den gegriffenen Klotz in der Ablagebox ab.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":24,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#202A34","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"shape","id":"sh/hgzmlsz2","slideIndex":0,"position":{"left":770,"top":870,"width":844,"height":514},"name":"Top view frame","geometry":"rect","fillColor":"#FFFFFF","lineColor":"#C9D5E1","lineWidth":1}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/wzyt0fm9","slideIndex":0,"position":{"left":770,"top":1394,"width":844,"height":34},"name":"Top view caption","text":"Abb. 1: Draufsicht mit Base-Kamera, Förderband, Greifbereich und Ablageposition","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":18,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#55616D","italic":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/bypcra5o","slideIndex":0,"position":{"left":770,"top":1474,"width":844,"height":48},"name":"Vision heading","text":"Identifikation im Kamerabild","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":36,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#2865AF","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/adgby543","slideIndex":0,"position":{"left":770,"top":1530,"width":844,"height":95},"name":"Vision text","text":"Das Debug-Bild zeigt zwei erkannte Klötze innerhalb der Region of Interest. Die IDs 10 und 11 erhalten jeweils eine Farbinformation und bleiben über mehrere Bilder hinweg zuordenbar.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":23,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#202A34","alignment":"left"}}
